  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "n8nWorkflowId": "hr56DcIeC1ap6NM7",
  "notes": "website_* product types still fall through to the 'Respond Not Implemented' branch (501) until Anthropic has billing configured. business_crm doesn't yet insert crm_services rows from build_config.services (v1 simplification). voice_agent creates a real Vapi Assistant + phone number directly on the CLIENT's own Vapi account via their byok_key (sent as a per-request Authorization header, never stored) - tested against the real Vapi API with an intentionally-wrong key to verify routing, prompt construction, and the invalid-key error path; the happy path (a real client key) has not been fired for real yet."
}
